%% D009: evidence contract first; numeric examples are optional editorial choices.
%% aoneahsan-cccs-search-indexing — full flow
flowchart TD
    trigger([Indexing work, or<br/>'why can nobody find this page?']) --> owned{Do we OWN the<br/>properties?}
    owned -->|no| props[GSC as a DOMAIN property via DNS TXT<br/>+ Bing + Yandex.<br/>A URL-prefix property splits www,<br/>https and subdomains apart]
    owned -->|yes| canon
    props --> tokens[Verification tokens go to<br/>docs/seo-verification.md FOR THE OWNER.<br/>🔴 Never guessed into HTML — a wrong<br/>token fails silently]
    tokens --> canon

    canon{🔴 Is the canonical<br/>self-referential on EVERY page,<br/>in the BUILT output?}
    canon -->|one hardcoded canonical| fixcanon[Every page is telling the engine to<br/>index a DIFFERENT page.<br/>GSC: 'Alternate page with proper<br/>canonical tag' — inspect Google-selected canonical]
    canon -->|set only at runtime| prerender[Check the target crawler's current rendering.<br/>Put the intended canonical in the<br/>representation being verified]
    canon -->|yes| state
    fixcanon --> verify1[grep the canonical out of<br/>dist/**/index.html — source and<br/>dev server prove nothing]
    prerender --> verify1
    verify1 --> state

    state{What does the GSC<br/>Pages report say?}
    state -->|Crawled - currently not indexed| content[Cause unknown.<br/>Inspect technical and content evidence<br/>before choosing a fix]
    state -->|Discovered - not indexed| budget[Inspect discovery, availability,<br/>crawl evidence and reporting delay<br/>before choosing a fix]
    state -->|Alternate page with canonical| fixcanon
    state -->|Soft 404| real[Real content, or a real 404]
    state -->|indexed| push

    content --> push
    budget --> push
    real --> push

    push{Pushing changes?}
    push -->|Bing / Yandex / Seznam| indexnow[IndexNow, CHANGED URLs only.<br/>Repeated unchanged submissions<br/>waste requests]
    push -->|Google| noapi[No general Google Indexing API for these pages.<br/>Request Indexing is manual<br/>and rate-limited]
    indexnow --> suppress
    noapi --> suppress

    suppress{Suppressing a page?}
    suppress -->|'do not list it'| noindex[noindex — 🔴 and do NOT also<br/>Disallow it, or the engine never<br/>SEES the noindex and it stays<br/>may remain indexed]
    suppress -->|'it is a duplicate'| canonical[canonical — a hint, and a<br/>Google may choose another canonical]
    suppress -->|'save crawl budget'| disallow[Disallow — says NOTHING<br/>about indexing]
    suppress -->|weak public page| never[Choose from evidence and intent:<br/>improve, consolidate, redirect,<br/>remove or noindex]
    noindex --> monitor
    canonical --> monitor
    disallow --> monitor
    never --> content

    monitor[On the recorded cadence:<br/>indexed count, queries and reasons<br/>with like-for-like scope]
    monitor --> drop{Indexed count FELL?}
    drop -->|yes| incident[Investigate reporting lag and recent<br/>canonical, robots, route, intent,<br/>deployment and rendering changes]
    drop -->|no| record
    incident --> record
    record([Record 'SEO Last applied' in the<br/>project CLAUDE.md, or the pass<br/>silently never runs again])

    classDef gateNode fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d97706,color:#7c2d12
    classDef terminal fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,color:#064e3b
    classDef warn fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class owned,canon,state,push,suppress,drop gateNode
    class trigger,record terminal
    class fixcanon,tokens,noindex,never warn
